    .feature-card
      .feature-icon ✅
      h3 Check Off Purchases
      p Mark items as complete while shopping. Never buy duplicates again.
    .feature-card
      .feature-icon 📊
      h3 Track Statistics
      p See your shopping patterns and manage your grocery habits effectively.
    .feature-card
      .feature-icon 💾
      h3 Save Favorites
      p Store frequently bought items for quick access next time.
    .feature-card
      .feature-icon 🔒
      h3 Secure & Private
      p Your lists are safe with us. End-to-end encryption for your data.
    .feature-card
      .feature-icon 📱
      h3 Access Anywhere
      p Use on any device. Your lists sync automatically across all platforms.
//  How It Works 
section.how-it-works#how-it-works
  h2.section-title How It Works
  .steps
    .step
      .step-number 1
      h3 Sign Up Free
      p Create your account in less than 30 seconds. No credit card required.
    .step
      .step-number 2
      h3 Create Your List
      p Start adding items to your shopping list. Organize by category or quantity.
    .step
      .step-number 3
      h3 Shop Smart
      p Check off items as you shop. Keep track of what you've bought.
    .step
      .step-number 4
      h3 Save & Repeat
      p Save your favorite lists and reuse them for future shopping trips.
//  CTA Section 
section.cta-section
  h2 Ready to Simplify Your Shopping?
  p Join thousands of smart shoppers who never forget an item.
  button.btn-cta(onclick="window.location.href=\'/auth/register\'") Start Your Free Account
